==Strategy==
This is a stage where you rush down Dark Dober before even more threatening enemies appear. Fend off the Ragin' Gories at the start with [[Ancient Egg: N112 (Rare Cat)|Cat Egg Pod]] and [[Talents|Talented]] [[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dark Lazer]], all the while building up cash with Talented [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] using the Gabriels and Doge Darks. Once Dark Dober appears, lure him to your base and rush him down with units like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Talented Awakened Bahamut]], [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:NX]], and [[Master of Mind Soractes (Special Cat)|Soractes]], mostly ignoring Ange Lackey. If you kill him before Tackey arrives, victory is almost guaranteed.

